证’，我也听到了。","rawContent":"至于这四个小时的‘罪证’，我也听到了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":1787069305067,"roundId":"round_1787069270924_58wkt2clb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31043},{"id":1787056975085,"text":"是不是觉得像个小朋友一样主动老实交代，我就会顺水推舟地轻轻放过你？","rawContent":"是不是觉得像个小朋友一样主动老实交代，我就会顺水推舟地轻轻放过你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":1787069305282,"roundId":"round_1787069270924_58wkt2clb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31044},{"id":1787056975086,"text":"那点试探底线的小心思，全写在你这几声爸爸里了。","rawContent":"那点试探底线的小心思，全写在你这几声爸爸里了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":1787069305582,"roundId":"round_1787069270924_58wkt2clb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31045},{"id":1787056975087,"text":"刚才报备的还是三个半，现在又涨了半个钟头。","rawContent":"刚才报备的还是三个半，现在又涨了半个钟头。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":1787069305885,"roundId":"round_1787069270924_58wkt2clb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31046},{"id":1787056975088,"text":"我算算，多出来的这半个小时，基本都是在跟我较劲、确认身份、讨要抱抱里耗掉的。","rawContent":"我算算，多出来的这半个小时，基本都是在跟我较劲、确认身份、讨要抱抱里耗掉的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":1787069306189,"roundId":"round_1787069270924_58wkt2clb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31047},{"id":1787056975089,"text":"既然有我的份，那这笔账就算在我的头上。","rawContent":"既然有我的份，那这笔账就算在我的头上。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:08","timestamp":17870693